    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’m just a ghost in my own life. every single thing i do, every word i say, it’s all just to satisfy my family and everyone else around me. i don't even know who i actually am anymore... it’s like i'm living in a cage that everyone else thinks is a home. i just want to be free of all these expectations. i just want it to stop.",
