    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "boundaries? i tried that. when i try to speak up or do something for myself, it’s just more fighting, more guilt, more people acting like i'm being selfish or crazy. there’s no way out of this here. the walls just get tighter every day. i don't think they'll ever change, and i don't think i can keep pretending forever. i just feel so tired of being stuck.",
