      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists won't help. they don't live my life. they don't understand how heavy it is to wake up every morning knowing you're just a puppet for everyone else. i look at it and there’s just no future where i’m actually me. it’s just a slow death anyway, just performing a role until i'm old. sometimes i think the only way to actually have control over anything... the only way to finally be free of all this... is to just leave it all behind. like, permanently.",
